    <string name="tools_compat_title">Blood compatibility</string>
    <string name="tools_compat_body">Who each blood group can donate to:\n\nO-  →  everyone\nO+  →  O+, A+, B+, AB+\nA-  →  A-, A+, AB-, AB+\nA+  →  A+, AB+\nB-  →  B-, B+, AB-, AB+\nB+  →  B+, AB+\nAB-  →  AB-, AB+\nAB+  →  AB+ only</string>
    <string name="tools_eligible_title">Can I donate?</string>
    <string name="tools_eligible_body">Common guidelines. The blood bank\'s screening makes the final decision.\n\n• Age 18 to 60 years\n• Weight at least 50 kg\n• Feeling healthy today, no fever or infection\n• At least 90 days since your last donation\n• Eat and drink well before donating</string>
    <string name="tools_benefits_title">Why donate</string>
    <string name="tools_benefits_body">• One donation can help save up to three lives\n• A quick check of pulse, blood pressure and haemoglobin before you donate\n• Your body replaces the donated blood within weeks\n• You become part of a network that responds in emergencies</string>
    <string name="tools_team_title">Our volunteers</string>
    <string name="tools_team_empty">No volunteers have been added yet.</string>
    <string name="tools_safety_title">Safety and privacy</string>
    <string name="tools_safety_body">• Meet donors at a hospital or blood bank\n• Blood is never sold on LifeBlood\n• Your phone number is only shown to signed-in members\n• You can hide yourself from search at any time using the availability switch</string>
    <string name="tools_close">Close</string>
